From c79470a486e5b8c33a918dcc565658986ade1085 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 12:24:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Beta Wave 1: fix P0s + quick P1s from readiness audit
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

P0-1 Post Edit dead route: new /post/edit/[id] screen (caption +
     visibility via existing getPostById/updatePost; owner-only, loading/
     error/retry states); PostCard's 4 Edit actions rewired to it
P0-2 LiveShareSheet: 'share with all' toggle now actually restricts —
     per-member checklist when off, allowedIds honors the selection,
     clear validation when none selected
P0-3 Pulse (home): wrapped in ScreenErrorBoundary like the other tabs;
     For You initial load shows a spinner instead of the misleading
     'No results for these filters' empty state
P1-4 Circle thread quick-button: pushed /circle/<id> (unmatched route) ->
     /circle
P1-5 Buddy application services/pricing step: -> buddy-dashboard/packages
     (services screen doesn't exist)
P1-10 Trip detail: network failure now shows 'Couldn't load this trip' +
      retry instead of masquerading as 'Trip not found'
P1-11 Thread error state: wired existing reload() to a Try again button

All mirrored to artifacts/travel-buddy
